<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">10052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A bulk carrier was struck by an unidentified projectile twenty-three miles northeast of Doha on Sunday, the first reported attack inside Qatar's exclusive zone since ceasefire talks resumed.</s> <s>UK Maritime Trade Operations logged the hit; the fire was extinguished, no casualties reported, no group's claimed responsibility.</s> <s>The mechanism is ugly... ceasefires are holding for tankers but not for bulk carriers, and an attacker seeking deniability has just discovered which lane permits it.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>South Africa's Constitutional Court ruled Parliament acted unconstitutionally by refusing for two years to convene an impeachment committee against President Cyril Ramaphosa over the Phala Phala cash scandal.</s> <s>Removal still requires a two-thirds vote no single party controls, but the bench has forced a coalition Parliament to do the political work it has actively avoided.</s> <s>African constitutional courts are becoming the load-bearing wall of accountability when ruling parties lose appetite for self-policing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Catholic Diocese of Wukari has documented over one hundred killed, ninety-eight thousand displaced, and two hundred and seventeen churches destroyed in southern Taraba State since September.</s> <s>Nigeria's federal government has not named what's happening, and armed groups have seized villages the displaced cannot return to.</s> <s>Whether Abuja calls these attackers criminals or militias will shape every international response that follows.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Congress party broke a three-decade alliance with the Dravida Munnetra Kazhagam in Tamil Nadu to back actor Vijay, whose Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam formed the state's newest government on Sunday.</s> <s>Prime Minister Modi framed the split as Congress betrayal of allies, courting Dravidian voters ahead of twenty twenty-nine.</s> <s>A film actor's party is now the pivot of national opposition arithmetic.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bahrain has stripped citizenship from a fresh batch of clerics, eulogists, women, and infants by royal decree, citing online support for Iran's retaliatory strikes.</s> <s>No court issued the order — only the king — and Iran's High Council for Human Rights called the practice unacceptable in any civilized legal system.</s> <s>Citizenship-stripping is the Gulf's preferred low-visibility instrument because the deportee, not the state, becomes the diplomatic problem.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Eighty-one Labour MPs can force a leadership confidence vote, and former junior minister Catherine West gave Britain's cabinet until Monday to replace Keir Starmer or she'd trigger one herself.</s> <s>Labour lost one thousand four hundred and ninety-two seats in last week's local elections, and Starmer's reset speech now collides with an open insurrection.</s> <s>What looked like a generational majority a year ago has become a question of survival.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel intercepted a one-hundred-and-seventy-person Gaza-bound flotilla in international waters off Greece, more than a thousand kilometres from Gaza.</s> <s>Two organisers were singled out for transfer to Ashkelon — one of them, Abu Keshek, was refused water for four days — while Israel filed no charges and released the rest.</s> <s>Spain and Brazil have summoned Israeli envoys; the legal threshold for an interception in international waters remains the unresolved question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's National Cybercrime Investigation Agency arrested one person in Chiniot for circulating AI-generated videos of journalist Gharida Farooqi during April's ceasefire coverage.</s> <s>The same statute regulators routinely wield against newsrooms is now being tested as a shield by the people newsrooms employ.</s> <s>Enforcement asymmetry, not statutory wording, decides whose speech a digital-rights regime actually protects.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran's Trade Promotion Organization says per-ton export value to thirty-nine African states rose twenty-five percent to five hundred and fifty-four dollars.</s> <s>The number is modest in absolute terms but signals where Tehran is rerouting commerce after Hormuz... toward import regimes with weaker secondary-sanctions exposure than Gulf or Asian routes.</s> <s>Post-war Iranian economic strategy is going south, not east.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi Aramco reported thirty-two and a half billion dollars in first-quarter profit even as the war shut Gulf shipping, because its East-West pipeline is moving seven million barrels a day to Yanbu past Hormuz entirely.</s> <s>Riyadh cut output by two million barrels a day, a volume Aramco says will hold prices.</s> <s>Who in the Gulf has Hormuz-bypass infrastructure, and who doesn't, is now the region's defining economic divide.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran-war fuel costs sank Spirit Airlines in two months, and one hundred and fourteen planes plus landing slots at LaGuardia and other slot-controlled airports will be auctioned to settle creditor claims.</s> <s>Seventeen thousand workers lost their jobs, and ultra-low fares on Caribbean leisure routes won't return.</s> <s>The bigger carriers absorbing those slots will not be passing on the savings.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Roughly one hundred vessels and two thousand three hundred crew remain trapped inside the Strait of Hormuz, the Hong Kong Shipowners Association says.</s> <s>Sailing out risks gunfire; the priority now is food, water, and psychological support, and China's called for unimpeded passage.</s> <s>The political language of blockade has become, for the seafarers themselves, a problem of weeks at anchor with no end announced.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A sixty-three-million-cubic-metre rock wedge detached above Alaska's Tracy Arm fjord last August, and a published reconstruction now shows the impact generated a five-hundred-metre run-up wave at the South Sawyer Glacier — among the tallest tsunamis ever instrumented.</s> <s>Glacial retreat is exposing oversteepened rock walls that have lost their ice buttress, and the failure mode is mass-wasting into deep water.</s> <s>This is a hazard category that isn't on most coastal-risk maps.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An environmental DNA survey of an Irish river surfaced Batrachochytrium dendrobatidis — the chytrid fungus that's devastated amphibian populations on every other continent it's reached.</s> <s>A single water scoop returned the pathogen alongside native frog DNA and human waste markers, and Ireland had no previous record of its presence.</s> <s>Conservation policy now has to react to a fungus the country didn't know it harboured.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers writing ahead of COP30 in Belém point out that ninety percent of excess planetary heat enters the ocean, and yet the UN climate framework has no ocean metrics in national reports and no integration into the Global Stocktake.</s> <s>It's a structural gap, the authors argue, not a knowledge one.</s> <s>Embedding ocean indicators before COP31 is the minimum needed for climate governance to track the planet it's actually managing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>An Ethiopian research team has built a wind-farm siting framework combining geographic information layers and machine learning, and it identifies North Shewa as the country's optimal corridor — sixteen hundred and ninety-eight kilometres of high-priority terrain.</s> <s>The model interpolates resource between sparse meteorological stations, contradicting the government's standing siting plan.</s> <s>African energy planning is moving from importing siting decisions to producing them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China has cancelled the Weibo account of Li Ying — known online as Teacher Li — fifty times, and yet two million followers continue to reach him through encrypted channels and virtual private networks.</s> <s>He receives images from ordinary Chinese and posts them to X, building the country's most-watched diaspora newsroom from a flat in Milan.</s> <s>He predicts more will speak out, in sha'Allah, as the cost of silence rises.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>